  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-15\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 15</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-1\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">En temps de paix, sont soumis aux rappels ordinaires les militaires en congé illimité visés à l'article 1er, § 1er,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">5°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">6°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">7°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"8°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">8°</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">En temps de paix, sont soumis aux rappels d'urgence les militaires en congé illimité visés à l'article 1er, § 1er,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">5°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">6°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">7°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"8°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">8°</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 3.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">En temps de paix, sont soumis aux rappels par mesure disciplinaire les militaires en congé illimité visés à l'article 1er, § 1er,</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">5°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">6°</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</article>",
